  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math>. Then, which one of the following is true?</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
